# Test that parse-toml-lite is NOT available without [include "stdlib/toml-lite.llt"]
# Uses try to capture the undefined-variable error as a value

[try [fn [] [parse-toml-lite "key = \"value\""]]]

=== out

Variant(Err, String("undefined variable: parse-toml-lite (did you mean the string \"parse-toml-lite\"? Use quotes.)"))

=== warn

undefined variable: parse-toml-lite
